{"case_id": "DEV-001", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-001-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R01", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 5, "requirement_id": "R01"}, "quote": "动力请求报文名称为 SYN_PowerReq，发送周期为 20 ms。报文中的请求有效标志 SYN_ReqValid：0 表示无效，1 表示有效，其他值保留。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-002", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-002-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R02", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 7, "requirement_id": "R02"}, "quote": "启动屏蔽期结束后，若距最后一帧有效 SYN_PowerReq 的时间达到 150 ms，则置位通信超时故障 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT。未达到该阈值不置位；不能用丢帧次数替代时间判定。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-003", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-003-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R01", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 5, "requirement_id": "R01"}, "quote": "动力请求报文名称为 SYN_PowerReq，发送周期为 20 ms。报文中的请求有效标志 SYN_ReqValid：0 表示无效，1 表示有效，其他值保留。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-004", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-004-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R07", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 20, "requirement_id": "R07"}, "quote": "供电电压 SYN_SupplyVoltage 严格低于 9 V 或严格高于 16 V，并连续保持 100 ms，才置位电压故障。电压回到闭区间 [9 V, 16 V] 时，尚未完成的异常持续计时归零；恰好 9 V 或 16 V 不属于异常。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-005", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-005-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R03", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 9, "requirement_id": "R03"}, "quote": "自控制器上电起的前 500 ms 为通信超时诊断屏蔽期。屏蔽期间仍接收并更新时间戳，但不置位 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT；屏蔽结束后按通信超时规则判定。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-006", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-006-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R04", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 11, "requirement_id": "R04"}, "quote": "SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT 置位后，连续收到 5 帧校验通过且 SYN_ReqValid=1 的 SYN_PowerReq，清除当前通信超时状态。中途收到无效帧则连续计数归零。此动作不等于清除已存储的诊断历史；本资料不规定历史清除服务。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-007", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-007-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R05", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 16, "requirement_id": "R05"}, "quote": "温度信号 SYN_MotorTemp 达到 90 ℃时进入热降额；只有温度降至 85 ℃或以下并连续保持 10 s，才退出热降额。资料不规定降额曲线或传感器标定参数。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-008", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-008-A1", "source_key": "spec_v2:R06", "locator": {"part": "word/document.xml", "body_child_1based": 18, "requirement_id": "R06"}, "quote": "只有 SYN_ReqValid=1 且当前没有 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT 时，才允许采用本帧请求值；否则本周期采用零请求值。资料未给出请求值的物理量程或最大允许扭矩。"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-009", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-009-A1", "source_key": "failures:SYN-F001", "locator": {"sheet": "失效案例", "sheet_part": "xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml", "row": 5, "header_row": 4, "columns": "ABCDE", "record_key": "SYN-F001"}, "quote": "案例编号: SYN-F001\n现象: 任务调度抖动时出现通信超时误报\n根因: 旧实现按丢帧次数累加，未使用最后有效帧时间戳\n修正措施: 改为时间差判定，阈值从所选规范版本读取\n验证记录: 注入调度抖动，分别检查阈值之前和恰好达到阈值时的行为"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-010", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-010-A1", "source_key": "failures:SYN-F002", "locator": {"sheet": "失效案例", "sheet_part": "xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml", "row": 6, "header_row": 4, "columns": "ABCDE", "record_key": "SYN-F002"}, "quote": "案例编号: SYN-F002\n现象: 上电阶段错误置位通信超时\n根因: 启动屏蔽期未实现\n修正措施: 屏蔽期间保留接收和时间戳更新，仅抑制故障置位\n验证记录: 覆盖上电初期、屏蔽结束前一刻及结束时刻"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-011", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-011-A1", "source_key": "failures:SYN-F003", "locator": {"sheet": "失效案例", "sheet_part": "xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml", "row": 7, "header_row": 4, "columns": "ABCDE", "record_key": "SYN-F003"}, "quote": "案例编号: SYN-F003\n现象: 短时电压越界引发故障误报\n根因: 正常电压出现后没有清零异常持续计时，多个短脉冲被累加\n修正措施: 电压回到正常闭区间时将异常持续计时归零\n验证记录: 注入 40 ms 越界、20 ms 正常、70 ms 越界，期望不置位故障"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
{"case_id": "DEV-012", "synthetic": true, "split": "dev", "human_review_status": "pending", "leakage_group": "synthetic-control-family", "evidence_notes": [{"anchor_id": "DEV-012-A1", "source_key": "failures:SYN-F004", "locator": {"sheet": "失效案例", "sheet_part": "xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml", "row": 8, "header_row": 4, "columns": "ABCDE", "record_key": "SYN-F004"}, "quote": "案例编号: SYN-F004\n现象: 通信超时恢复条件过早满足\n根因: 无效帧没有清零连续有效帧计数\n修正措施: 无效帧使计数归零，再等待连续 5 帧有效报文\n验证记录: 注入有效、有效、无效、有效序列，期望当前通信超时状态仍保留"}], "unanswerable_rationale": null}
